&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Designer to design, prototype, and launch CivGov and Commercial Solutions and define how users interact with and derive insights from Planet’s satellite Earth Observation (EO) data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will bridge the gap between Planet’s platform capabilities and valuable customer outcomes. With a relentless focus on the user, you will define user profiles, establish jobs-to-be-done, and design end-to-end user flows for high-value market opportunities. You will collaborate closely with Product and Engineering to decompose these workflows into scalable, reusable UX building blocks, ultimately crafting cohesive, customer-centric solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, hybrid role which will require you to work from our Berlin or Haarlem office 3 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Design Leadership: Drive the end-to-end design process, from initial discovery and user research to prototyping and high-fidelity execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Validation: Lead user research and prototype testing to validate high-value use cases within CivGov and Commercial ensuring all development is grounded in validated user needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User-Centric Goal Setting: Define clear objectives based on user discovery (e.g., identifying success criteria for a CivGov compliance officer) to drive meaningful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design &amp;amp; Architecture: Architect intuitive interfaces that translate complex geospatial data into actionable insights, establishing reusable interaction patterns and components for Planet’s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Strategy: Partner with product and engineering to ensure top-tier design quality; facilitate cross-team collaboration to align on ambiguous problem spaces and bridge the gap between technical capability and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design Culture: Actively contribute to building and elevating Planet’s design culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years designing complex SaaS or B2B products, taking projects from early ideation to launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in design or an equivalent field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end experience, in terms of taking projects from early ideation to live software, and iterating based on feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid portfolio displaying complex professional projects, your process, and the resulting impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting user research and usability testing, synthesizing findings into actionable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing sophisticated, data-heavy applications, ideally featuring AI-powered tools or geospatial data visualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid core skillset: UX/UI, interaction design, rapid prototyping, accessibility, and visual design principles. Proficiency in Figma and enterprise design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work quickly in undefined and ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GIS, geospatial data, or remote sensing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-native mindset, utilizing AI tools for creative ideation, design, or prototype generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of taking ownership to communicate and solve complex, systemic problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep empathy for both end-users and internal stakeholders, expertly balancing usability with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience thriving in growth-focused, highly collaborative team environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
