&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1966&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e87c3e2586e1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;In-Person Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Amazing things happen when passionate, smart, and purposeful people get together in the same room. With offices across Geneva, Zürich, Barcelona, London and more, you&#39;ll spend most of your time collaborating face-to-face with people who genuinely care about what they&#39;re building&lt;/p&gt;
