&lt;ul data-local-id=&quot;58f5bd53-36c9-4ea7-b240-be334fac1294&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;717&quot; data-local-id=&quot;17fd21a9-b568-43e7-85ba-e56c0c901e35&quot;&gt;Build and operate core data platform applications such as Airflow, QuickSight, Data Export API, and CubeJS to enable self-service and scalable data usage across &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;MOIA&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;887&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f6b89734-7b89-4d59-bc43-db6adf01a949&quot;&gt;Design, implement, and maintain APIs and platform services, with a strong focus on reliability, performance, and developer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1025&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a7d06c53-9fa9-4c91-8152-66ffeee7938d&quot;&gt;Develop and deploy serverless and containerized applications using AWS services like Lambda, API Gateway, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ECS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;/Fargate, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EKS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, and S3.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1160&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7065901d-0c93-4015-baae-27efcea57a9f&quot;&gt;Automate infrastructure provisioning using Infrastructure as Code and ensure secure, scalable, and observable systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1282&quot; data-local-id=&quot;62ab4dfa-6171-4fc0-9de7-7235b8674a0f&quot;&gt;Collaborate with teams across multiple domains, helping them integrate with and build on top of the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1395&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e21a0f43-c073-4ee0-bf68-6771df6c1abe&quot;&gt;Contribute to our team’s learning culture by sharing knowledge, mentoring, and participating in learning days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
